Package: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.bgservices
Name: Background Services
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Settings > Background Services has a switch for each Apple background service that can be turned off (Twitter, Weibo, Facebook sharing, Game Center, usage statistics). Off stops it, and it stays off after a restart.
Maintainer: steve
Author: steve
Section: Tweaks
